            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[- Threads are grouped the way Karui for iPhone's History groups them: email threads by subject without the "Re:", Slack channels by name, X posts by their text, chats by the group's name or the person
- Apps, Senders, and Threads are tables now: sort by any column, drag columns to reorder or resize, and the layout is remembered
]]></description>
